WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.867
Open the setup flow for the website you own and use the snippet generated for that exact site.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:12.882
A public site identifier tells RankLens which site sent an event; it is not a password.

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:16.642
Do not copy a server token into this browser script.

00:00:16.842 --> 00:00:22.269
Paste the script into the head of every page you want to measure.

00:00:22.269 --> 00:00:27.278
In a framework, the shared root layout is usually the right place.

00:00:27.278 --> 00:00:31.453
For a tag manager, use the documented custom HTML option.

00:00:31.453 --> 00:00:35.628
Keep the configured domain and the installed site ID consistent.

00:00:35.828 --> 00:00:43.729
Deploy the site, open a page on the configured HTTPS domain, and refresh the matching report.

00:00:43.729 --> 00:00:46.693
Give the request time to arrive.

00:00:46.693 --> 00:00:54.594
If it remains empty, confirm the site ID, domain, content security policy, and browser network request.

00:00:54.594 --> 00:00:59.039
Local preview traffic is not proof of production tracking.
